<body><div style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px; color: windowtext"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Transdisciplinary work is a process — and so is gathering and collecting knowledge about it. </span><span style="margin: 0px">So far, there are still few ready-made tools for assessment in transdisciplinary education.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US" style="color: windowtext; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">More information will follow soon.</span><span style="color: windowtext; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 16px 0px; color: windowtext"><span style="color: windowtext; margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><br></span></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px; color: windowtext"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Sign up for the newsletter</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"> to stay informed about content updates!</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px; color: windowtext"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">P.S.</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"> Do you already have a tool, or have you recently come across new practical resources</span><span style="margin: 0px">?&nbsp;</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Please let us know!</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></div></body>
